    "description_html": "<h1>Storefront</h1>\n<p>The default Shopclass theme for classifieds sites. It has a card-grid layout, three colour palettes, light and dark schemes, and plain JavaScript with no jQuery.</p>\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n<ul><li>Shopclass 7.0.0 or later. Sites on an older core stay on Storefront 1.3.x.</li><li>PHP 8.0 or later</li><li>No plugins needed.</li></ul>\n<h2>Install</h2>\n<p>Shopclass bundles Storefront and activates it on a fresh install. To install it yourself:</p>\n<ol><li>Go to <strong>Appearance → Manage themes</strong>.</li><li>Find Storefront in <strong>Browse</strong>, or upload <code>storefront_X.Y.Z.zip</code> from the <a href=\"https://github.com/mindstellar/theme-storefront/releases\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">releases</a>.</li><li>Click <strong>Install</strong>, then <strong>Activate</strong>.</li></ol>\n<h2>Set up</h2>\n<ol><li>Go to <strong>Appearance → Storefront: Brand</strong>:<ul><li><strong>Site name</strong>: the wordmark shown when no logo is set.</li><li><strong>Logo</strong>: SVG, PNG or JPG. An SVG is cleaned on upload and follows the text colour, so one file works in light and dark. PNG and JPG are saved to <code>oc-content/uploads/</code>.</li><li><strong>Compact logo (optional)</strong>: a small mark for phones. The main logo shows if it is empty.</li></ul></li><li>Go to <strong>Appearance → Storefront: Settings</strong>:<ul><li><strong>Colour palette</strong>: Teal, Indigo or Violet.</li><li><strong>Colour scheme</strong>: Light, Dark or Auto (follow device).</li><li><strong>Home / Hero</strong>: <strong>Headline</strong> and <strong>Tagline</strong>, plus switches for the decorative graphic, the popular-category chips and the featured listings row.</li><li><strong>Search &amp; Location</strong>: <strong>Post &amp; edit form location</strong> (autocomplete or dropdowns), <strong>Search page location</strong> (country, region and city; region and city; or autocomplete), <strong>Search box placeholder</strong> and <strong>Default results view</strong> (gallery or list).</li><li><strong>Footer &amp; Social</strong>: <strong>Footer tagline</strong>, links for Facebook, X, Instagram, YouTube and LinkedIn, and the &quot;Powered by Shopclass&quot; credit.</li></ul></li><li>Press <strong>Save</strong>. An empty text field restores its default.</li></ol>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul><li>Every palette and scheme pair meets WCAG 2.1 AA contrast.</li><li>Right-to-left locales switch the layout by themselves.</li><li>Featured listings on the home page, related listings and custom fields on the item page.</li><li>Widget zones: <code>header</code>, <code>footer</code> and <code>item_sidebar</code>.</li><li>Core draws the account, sign-in, profile, contact and credits pages inside Storefront&#039;s header and footer. The theme styles them through hooks in <code>inc/core-pages.php</code>.</li></ul>\n<h2>Customising</h2>\n<p>Settings are stored as theme preferences, so they survive updates. For deeper changes, edit the design tokens at the top of <code>css/storefront.css</code> (<code>--color-*</code>, <code>--font-*</code>, <code>--space-*</code>, <code>--radius-*</code>, <code>--shadow-*</code>) or use a child theme.</p>\n<h2>For developers</h2>\n<ul><li>Hooks fired:<p>| Hook | Where | |---|---| | <code>header</code>, <code>footer</code> | End of <code>&lt;head&gt;</code>, before <code>&lt;/body&gt;</code> | | <code>before-main</code>, <code>after-main</code> | Around the main content | | <code>search_ads_listing_top</code> | Top of home and search results | | <code>search_ads_listing_medium</code> | Every 6 search results | | <code>home_before_featured</code>, <code>home_after_featured</code> | Around the featured row | | <code>home_before_listings</code>, <code>home_after_listings</code> | Around the latest-listings row | | <code>item_meta</code>, <code>item_detail</code> | Item page body | | <code>item_before_related</code>, <code>item_after_related</code> | Around the related row | | <code>item_sidebar</code> | Item page aside | | <code>item_contact_form</code> | Inside the seller contact form |</p></li><li><code>css/</code> and <code>js/</code> run as they are. <code>npm install</code> then <code>npm run build</code> writes the <code>*.min.*</code> files and compiles <code>languages/*/theme.mo</code>. Both are gitignored.</li><li>Strings use the text domain <code>storefront</code>. Run <code>npm run i18n</code> to update <code>languages/storefront.pot</code> and <code>languages/en_US/theme.po</code>.</li><li>To work on the theme, clone it and symlink it into <code>oc-content/themes/storefront</code>.</li><li>A <code>vX.Y.Z</code> tag runs <code>.github/workflows/release.yml</code>, which builds and publishes <code>storefront_X.Y.Z.zip</code>.</li></ul>\n<h2>Support</h2>\n<p>Report problems at <a href=\"https://github.com/mindstellar/theme-storefront/issues\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">github.com/mindstellar/theme-storefront/issues</a>.</p>\n<h2>License</h2>\n<p>GPL-3.0-or-later. Copyright Navjot Tomer (Mindstellar) and contributors.</p>",
